abstract: >-
  Research software and computational evidence for a deterministic two-player
  shared-pool Mahjong achievement game. Complete SAFE-state retrograde analysis
  and reverse-direction replay classify the empty position as a second-player
  win. The computational algorithms share rules and indexing. End-to-end Lean
  verification remains in progress at this release.
